  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你好，你占了我的车位，麻烦挪一下车，我在开会呢，晚点再说吧。你好，好像看到有人刮到你车了，赶紧来看看什么，我马上下来，谢谢你啊。还有一道菜这么久没上，还没做就退了吧，不好意思，已经下锅做了。哎，好吧，我们的菜做了没没做的话，帮我换一道菜吧，还没做呢，我帮您改单，没做就退了吧。买单你好，我的卡被取款机吞了，麻烦赶紧过来处理一下，已帮您登记，七十二小时内会为您处理。你们取款机出问题了，一直在往外吐钱，我都不敢碰。什么？您稍等，我们马上派人过去充电宝和香水，不符合携带规定，可马上登机了，我能先放这儿吗？晚点，我让家人来取，抱歉，我们没法保管。那算了，丢了吧。你好，我捡到了个充电宝和香水，找不着失主。好的，男士交给我们就行。我充电宝和香水放失物招认处了，你晚点来帮我取一下。领导，我家里有事想请假，一周回趟老家请假，一周太久了，项目正在关键期，你请假，我就只能换人了。领导，我家里有急事，原本需要请假一个月，但我考虑到项目正在关键期，所以我把请假压缩到了一周。不错，你快去快回吧。你好，我觉得你们房间里的香氛不错，想买点带回去，不好意思，男士房间里的物品概不出卖。哎，那算了吧。你好，我不小心把房间里的香氛摔坏了。抱歉，先生损坏房间物品要照价赔偿，香氛原价两百元，给你折扣赔款八十元。好的，没问题。你好，我刚才洗完头用房间里的吹风机吹一半就坏了，能给我换一个吗？抱歉，先生。根据酒店规定，损坏房间物品要照价赔偿。我要投诉房间吹风机质量太差，吹着头突然冒烟，吓死我了。抱歉，先生，我们马上给你处理房费，给你减免，并送你一份下午茶点心，请您消消气。好吧，这事儿就算了。你好，我老婆的钻戒好像落在酒店了，麻烦你们帮我找一下。不好意思，先生，我们没有看到，请你去其他地方问问。你好，你们打扫卫生时，把我老婆的钻戒搞丢了。好的，马上帮你核实。你好，确实捡到一枚钻戒，你看什么时候来取呢？我明天过来取，帮我收好牛啊，你怎么做到的？多亏了我父母，从小就让我看这本闲谈高手，才学会这套处事思路。如果你总感觉自己很老实，又没心眼，遇到事儿不知道怎么巧妙的处理。推荐你看看这本闲谈高手，他的所有能遇到的情况都给你一一列出来，让你轻松摆平。各种社交场合讲的全是怎么做人，怎么处事、怎么沟通，怎么去博弈，怎么防身，怎么化解，让你问答都有谋略。当遇到解决不了的麻烦事儿，不是你自己有多笨，而是你不知道该怎么说。如果你认真看完这本闲谈，高手还说没城府，不会巧妙的处理事情，这是不可能的。一句顶一万句的社交谋略话术尽在这套书中。这是一套教你如何在言谈举止中得握分寸、从容处事的指南。学了三分，你就能在工作和生活当中得心应手，事半功倍。平时总看这本闲谈高手，真是学到了很多的方法。行走江湖居之必备事，谈高手。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 460,
      "end_ms": 840,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1120,
      "end_ms": 2080,
      "text": "你占了我的车位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2440,
      "end_ms": 3320,
      "text": "麻烦挪一下车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3900,
      "end_ms": 4920,
      "text": "我在开会呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4940,
      "end_ms": 5845,
      "text": "晚点再说吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8630,
      "end_ms": 9010,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9450,
      "end_ms": 11150,
      "text": "好像看到有人刮到你车了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11170,
      "end_ms": 12570,
      "text": "赶紧来看看什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12750,
      "end_ms": 13570,
      "text": "我马上下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13730,
      "end_ms": 14495,
      "text": "谢谢你啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17420,
      "end_ms": 18720,
      "text": "还有一道菜这么久没上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 18880,
      "end_ms": 19900,
      "text": "还没做就退了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20000,
      "end_ms": 20620,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20720,
      "end_ms": 21795,
      "text": "已经下锅做了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 23910,
      "end_ms": 24150,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 24570,
      "end_ms": 25090,
      "text": "好吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25690,
      "end_ms": 27830,
      "text": "我们的菜做了没没做的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 28290,
      "end_ms": 29390,
      "text": "帮我换一道菜吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 30110,
      "end_ms": 30930,
      "text": "还没做呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 30950,
      "end_ms": 31770,
      "text": "我帮您改单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 32790,
      "end_ms": 33810,
      "text": "没做就退了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 33990,
      "end_ms": 35470,
      "text": "买单你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 36110,
      "end_ms": 37450,
      "text": "我的卡被取款机吞了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 37510,
      "end_ms": 38850,
      "text": "麻烦赶紧过来处理一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 40030,
      "end_ms": 41090,
      "text": "已帮您登记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 41630,
      "end_ms": 43665,
      "text": "七十二小时内会为您处理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 46110,
      "end_ms": 47450,
      "text": "你们取款机出问题了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 47990,
      "end_ms": 49130,
      "text": "一直在往外吐钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 49450,
      "end_ms": 50190,
      "text": "我都不敢碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 50870,
      "end_ms": 51270,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 51750,
      "end_ms": 52410,
      "text": "您稍等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 53010,
      "end_ms": 56230,
      "text": "我们马上派人过去充电宝和香水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 56530,
      "end_ms": 57610,
      "text": "不符合携带规定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 58290,
      "end_ms": 59270,
      "text": "可马上登机了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 59290,
      "end_ms": 60310,
      "text": "我能先放这儿吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 60370,
      "end_ms": 60710,
      "text": "晚点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 60710,
      "end_ms": 61605,
      "text": "我让家人来取，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 61980,
      "end_ms": 62445,
      "text": "抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 62720,
      "end_ms": 63495,
      "text": "我们没法保管。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 65540,
      "end_ms": 66165,
      "text": "那算了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 66410,
      "end_ms": 66915,
      "text": "丢了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 67220,
      "end_ms": 67560,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 67760,
      "end_ms": 69280,
      "text": "我捡到了个充电宝和香水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 69420,
      "end_ms": 70100,
      "text": "找不着失主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 70180,
      "end_ms": 70460,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 70460,
      "end_ms": 71495,
      "text": "男士交给我们就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 72450,
      "end_ms": 74410,
      "text": "我充电宝和香水放失物招认处了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 74490,
      "end_ms": 75765,
      "text": "你晚点来帮我取一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 76110,
      "end_ms": 76635,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 77220,
      "end_ms": 79430,
      "text": "我家里有事想请假，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 79430,
      "end_ms": 81600,
      "text": "一周回趟老家请假，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 81600,
      "end_ms": 82585,
      "text": "一周太久了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 83390,
      "end_ms": 84585,
      "text": "项目正在关键期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 85240,
      "end_ms": 85740,
      "text": "你请假，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 85740,
      "end_ms": 86820,
      "text": "我就只能换人了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 86960,
      "end_ms": 87535,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 88020,
      "end_ms": 88925,
      "text": "我家里有急事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 89260,
      "end_ms": 90595,
      "text": "原本需要请假一个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 90900,
      "end_ms": 92525,
      "text": "但我考虑到项目正在关键期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 92980,
      "end_ms": 94525,
      "text": "所以我把请假压缩到了一周。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 95690,
      "end_ms": 96090,
      "text": "不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 96730,
      "end_ms": 97885,
      "text": "你快去快回吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 98180,
      "end_ms": 98645,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 99360,
      "end_ms": 101345,
      "text": "我觉得你们房间里的香氛不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 101880,
      "end_ms": 102715,
      "text": "想买点带回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 103650,
      "end_ms": 104310,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 104310,
      "end_ms": 107175,
      "text": "男士房间里的物品概不出卖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 109100,
      "end_ms": 109445,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 109930,
      "end_ms": 110645,
      "text": "那算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 111620,
      "end_ms": 112100,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 112700,
      "end_ms": 114675,
      "text": "我不小心把房间里的香氛摔坏了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 115080,
      "end_ms": 115440,
      "text": "抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 115440,
      "end_ms": 118225,
      "text": "先生损坏房间物品要照价赔偿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 118730,
      "end_ms": 120095,
      "text": "香氛原价两百元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 120460,
      "end_ms": 122055,
      "text": "给你折扣赔款八十元。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 122840,
      "end_ms": 123260,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 123400,
      "end_ms": 123965,
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 124250,
      "end_ms": 124590,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 124910,
      "end_ms": 128170,
      "text": "我刚才洗完头用房间里的吹风机吹一半就坏了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 128170,
      "end_ms": 129175,
      "text": "能给我换一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 129870,
      "end_ms": 130230,
      "text": "抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 130230,
      "end_ms": 130635,
      "text": "先生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 131040,
      "end_ms": 132100,
      "text": "根据酒店规定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 132240,
      "end_ms": 134185,
      "text": "损坏房间物品要照价赔偿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 137160,
      "end_ms": 139735,
      "text": "我要投诉房间吹风机质量太差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 140070,
      "end_ms": 141030,
      "text": "吹着头突然冒烟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 141050,
      "end_ms": 141785,
      "text": "吓死我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 142180,
      "end_ms": 142500,
      "text": "抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 142500,
      "end_ms": 142840,
      "text": "先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 142840,
      "end_ms": 144100,
      "text": "我们马上给你处理房费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 144100,
      "end_ms": 144620,
      "text": "给你减免，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 144700,
      "end_ms": 146020,
      "text": "并送你一份下午茶点心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 146080,
      "end_ms": 146775,
      "text": "请您消消气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 150490,
      "end_ms": 151115,
      "text": "好吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 151260,
      "end_ms": 152065,
      "text": "这事儿就算了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 152430,
      "end_ms": 152830,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 153420,
      "end_ms": 155405,
      "text": "我老婆的钻戒好像落在酒店了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 155680,
      "end_ms": 156835,
      "text": "麻烦你们帮我找一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 157870,
      "end_ms": 158615,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 158860,
      "end_ms": 159275,
      "text": "先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 159590,
      "end_ms": 160425,
      "text": "我们没有看到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 160630,
      "end_ms": 161975,
      "text": "请你去其他地方问问。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 164640,
      "end_ms": 165020,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 165340,
      "end_ms": 166280,
      "text": "你们打扫卫生时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 166280,
      "end_ms": 167685,
      "text": "把我老婆的钻戒搞丢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 168360,
      "end_ms": 168780,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 169000,
      "end_ms": 169945,
      "text": "马上帮你核实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 172640,
      "end_ms": 173020,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 173240,
      "end_ms": 174455,
      "text": "确实捡到一枚钻戒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 174770,
      "end_ms": 176005,
      "text": "你看什么时候来取呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 176510,
      "end_ms": 177415,
      "text": "我明天过来取，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 177680,
      "end_ms": 180510,
      "text": "帮我收好牛啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 180650,
      "end_ms": 181570,
      "text": "你怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 182070,
      "end_ms": 183070,
      "text": "多亏了我父母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 183230,
      "end_ms": 185050,
      "text": "从小就让我看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 185270,
      "end_ms": 186790,
      "text": "才学会这套处事思路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 187250,
      "end_ms": 188930,
      "text": "如果你总感觉自己很老实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 189030,
      "end_ms": 189770,
      "text": "又没心眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 189950,
      "end_ms": 191810,
      "text": "遇到事儿不知道怎么巧妙的处理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 192110,
      "end_ms": 193790,
      "text": "推荐你看看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 193930,
      "end_ms": 196590,
      "text": "他的所有能遇到的情况都给你一一列出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 196770,
      "end_ms": 197790,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 197790,
      "end_ms": 200490,
      "text": "各种社交场合讲的全是怎么做人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 200570,
      "end_ms": 201870,
      "text": "怎么处事、怎么沟通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 201930,
      "end_ms": 202690,
      "text": "怎么去博弈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 202810,
      "end_ms": 203470,
      "text": "怎么防身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 203590,
      "end_ms": 204310,
      "text": "怎么化解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 204450,
      "end_ms": 205810,
      "text": "让你问答都有谋略。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 206030,
      "end_ms": 207850,
      "text": "当遇到解决不了的麻烦事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 207930,
      "end_ms": 209345,
      "text": "不是你自己有多笨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 209740,
      "end_ms": 211040,
      "text": "而是你不知道该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 211740,
      "end_ms": 213480,
      "text": "如果你认真看完这本闲谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 213480,
      "end_ms": 215060,
      "text": "高手还说没城府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 215340,
      "end_ms": 216800,
      "text": "不会巧妙的处理事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 216920,
      "end_ms": 217860,
      "text": "这是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 217920,
      "end_ms": 220860,
      "text": "一句顶一万句的社交谋略话术尽在这套书中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 221200,
      "end_ms": 225220,
      "text": "这是一套教你如何在言谈举止中得握分寸、从容处事的指南。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 225680,
      "end_ms": 226420,
      "text": "学了三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 226660,
      "end_ms": 229000,
      "text": "你就能在工作和生活当中得心应手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 229080,
      "end_ms": 229760,
      "text": "事半功倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 229940,
      "end_ms": 231560,
      "text": "平时总看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 231580,
      "end_ms": 233060,
      "text": "真是学到了很多的方法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 233200,
      "end_ms": 235280,
      "text": "行走江湖居之必备事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_59fd41e03e7a878f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 235280,
      "end_ms": 235845,
      "text": "谈高手。"
    }
  ],
